cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software release and the paper below."
title: "INFANT AI Competition Platform"
abstract: >-
  An open-source web platform for hosting machine-learning competitions on clinical data,
  built at the INFANT Research Centre, University College Cork, and used to run a competition
  to grade the severity of EEG background abnormalities in newborns with hypoxic-ischaemic
  encephalopathy. Includes the weighted Matthews correlation coefficient used to rank the
  leaderboards.
type: software
version: 2.0.0
